"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-27T19:09:13Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2836738893,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDI4MzY3Mzg4OTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/2836738893","actor":{"login":"gytis","id":196395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis","html_url":"https://github.com/gytis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-27T19:09:13Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/562136012","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/5816#issuecomment-562136012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/5816","id":562136012,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2MjEzNjAxMg==","user":{"login":"gytis","id":196395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis","html_url":"https://github.com/gytis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-12-05T13:49:02Z","updated_at":"2019-12-05T13:49:02Z","body":"While this approach makes sense, it will not align with a standard Spring Web behaviour. I've been experimenting with exception handler and found that custom content type will be returned only if a client has  added `Accept` header. Otherwise, even if a controller method has different content type, object returned by an error handler will be mapped to JSON. Here's an example that I have tried:\r\n\r\nController method\r\n```java\r\n@GetMapping(path = \"xml\", produces = APPLICATION_XML_VALUE)\r\npublic Error xmlError() {\r\n    throw new RuntimeException(\"xml\");\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nException handler in a controller advice class\r\n```java\r\n@ExceptionHandler(RuntimeException.class)\r\npublic Error runtimeExceptionHandler(Throwable t) {\r\n  return new Error(t.getMessage()); // Error is a simple POJO with a 'message' field and a getter\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest cases\r\n```java\r\n@Test // Passes\r\npublic void shouldGetXmlError() {\r\n  given().accept(XML)\r\n    .when().get(\"/xml\")\r\n    .then()\r\n    .statusCode(200)\r\n    .contentType(XML)\r\n    .body(is(\"<Error><message>xml</message></Error>\"));\r\n}\r\n\r\n@Test // Passes\r\npublic void shouldOnlyAllowAskingForXmlError() {\r\n  given().accept(JSON)\r\n    .when().get(\"/xml\")\r\n    .then()\r\n    .statusCode(406);\r\n}\r\n\r\n@Test // Fails\r\npublic void shouldGetXmlErrorWithoutAsking() {\r\n  when().get(\"/xml\")\r\n    .then()\r\n    .statusCode(200)\r\n    .contentType(XML) // Response content type is JSON\r\n    .body(is(\"<Error><message>xml</message></Error>\"));\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/562136012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gytis","id":196395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis","html_url":"https://github.com/gytis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/562136760","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/5816#issuecomment-562136760","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/5816","id":562136760,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2MjEzNjc2MA==","user":{"login":"gytis","id":196395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis","html_url":"https://github.com/gytis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-12-05T13:50:58Z","updated_at":"2019-12-05T13:50:58Z","body":"Even though it might not be correct to look into a controller for a content type, we should definitely look into request headers before defaulting to `application/json`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/562136760/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gytis","id":196395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis","html_url":"https://github.com/gytis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gytis/received_events","type":"User","user_v